{"product_id":"complete-reiki-tutor-a-structured-course-to-achieve-professional-expertise","title":"Complete Reiki Tutor: A Structured Course to Achieve Professional Expertise","description":"\u003cp\u003eWith text by a foremost Reiki Master-Tutor and an endorsement by Reiki Outreach International-the world's leading organization for the promotion of Reiki healing-this is simply the best guide on the topic. Expert author Tanmaya Honervogt addresses every facet of Usui Reiki, including the three Reiki degrees, symbols and mantras, and hand positions used to transfer the \"Universal Life Energy.\" She supplies an introduction to Reiki's origins and development, explains how it works, and offers advice on finding the right Reiki course. Specialized sections focus on using Reiki for common ailments and healing the spirit, as well as setting up a professional practice and handling therapist\/client issues. It's the essential source book for all students and practitioners.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 191 x 254\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tanmaya Honervogt\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781856752824\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 312\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45867795742873,"sku":"17RC-1-9781856752824","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690dafeed2395_Complete_Reiki_Tutor_A_Structured_Course_to_Achieve_Professional_Expertise__1.png?v=1762507666","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/complete-reiki-tutor-a-structured-course-to-achieve-professional-expertise","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}